                           "TextFadeDuration": 8.600000000000001,
                           "FadeInTime": 0.2,
                           "FadeOutTime": 0.2,
                           "String": "Objectives:\n• Place 10 Roman Legion units in the Syracuse forum (raised area marked by two yellow flags).\n• Do not kill Archimedes (Priest).",
