                           "FadeInTime": 0.2,
                           "FadeOutTime": 0.2,
                           "String": "Objectives:\n• Destroy the three Docks in Carthage's harbor\n• Bring Scipio to the blue flags at Carthage's Byrsa Forum",
                           "ImageRect": {
                              "x": 0,
